                  === VETERAN PLAYER NEWS ===

You are past level 19, which unlocks a few things.

  help                  your help listing now includes staff-facing
                        topics that lower-level players do not see.
  people                you appear in the veteran listing.

WHAT ACTUALLY THREATENS YOU NOW
  Mega-Damage is the ceiling, not level. A Mega-Damage creature ignores
  any weapon that is not itself MDC, no matter how experienced you are.
  Check what you are wielding before committing to a fight in the
  Preserves, the Lone Star complex, or the deeper catacombs.
  Protective spell fields are depleting pools, not flat resistance.
  Armor of Ithan, Invincible Armor, and psychic body field absorb a
  fixed amount and then stop. They do not scale with your level.

THINGS WORTH DOING AT THIS POINT
  Faction standing matters in Coalition territory. Registration sweeps
  in Coalition towns check whether you read as a D-Bee, and worn armor
  can change that reading.
  Rift travel opens the whole world. Moxim NPCs sit in Chi-Town,
  Splynn, New Camelot, Tolkeen, Lazlo, and Praxis.
  You can request skills beyond your OCC package. skillrequest submits
  one to the roleplay staff for review; you get one pending request at
  a time.
  request title <title> asks staff for a roleplay prefix title.

IF YOU WANT TO BUILD
  Staff positions exist for coding, domain building, and roleplay. The
  apprentice track takes submissions through domain review and a coding
  queue. Ask an admin how to enter it.

Report problems with bug, typo, or idea. They are read.
